file transformer/writer:

```text
qdae.search(Context, String, long, int) -> builds cache/<bookId>/<cid>.s and calls
qdae.search(String sourcePath, String destPath, String bookId, int chapterId)

qdae.search(String sourcePath, String destPath, String bookId, int chapterId)
